Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:44.91,Episode Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(565,518)}{\pos(485.4,306.2)}Episode 2           Confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.96,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is your little sister, Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.08,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,She seems a lot younger than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:49.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She's in her first year \Nof elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:51.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:54.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I always end up spoiling her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:58.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, must be nice having \Na little sister... wish I had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.72,main,Little Sister Rin,0,0,0,,Can I have another piece \Nof candy? Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And now I have one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:10.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hang on, there's no reason she needs \Nto be in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:15.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I guess I ended up basing \Nher on my own sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:16.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Kind of an airhead call, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I mean, that was...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:24.39,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That said, you being an airheaded big \Nsister is a major plus, Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.42,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A plus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:28.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What kind of sister \Nstuff do you normally do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:30.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I kind of treat her like a kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.63,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I pat her head and squish her cheeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:38.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That sounds great. I wouldn't mind \Na nice big sister, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:42.53,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Were you about to squish my cheeks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:44.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That'd be going too far, even for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.14,sign_3972_22_For_a_long_time,Hand sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\frz121.9\move(212.4,150.2,241.2,166.2,25,1485)}For a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What's that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A line I wanted to learn today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"I'm so scared. Is it okay if I sleep \Nwith you tonight, Onii-chan?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:00.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That is not what it says!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You really oughta learn that one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Better write it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:10.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not going to bother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:12.79,sign_4593_31_For_a_long_time_,Hand Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H20212C&\frz36.31\pos(185.2,350.2)}{\blur0.4}For a long time\Nthis place has been          I'm so scared
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:12.79,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.40,main - top,Rin,0,0,0,,I messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ha, I got you to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:20.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There are a lot of lines I {\i1}actually{\i0} \Nneed to memorize!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here, you can use my blank slate hands, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:30.07,main,Little Sister Rin,0,0,0,,I hate you, big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:33.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She's in her rebellious phase?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:38.29,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I guess there are some lines you can \Nmemorize without writing them down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:52.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,N... Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:55.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I need to rehearse crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:59.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, you were acting! That's a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I almost gave you a big hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't stop crying because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:17.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please, stop being so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:22.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I honestly can't deal \Nwith this sort of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:27.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't really expect you to be able to \Nhandle someone who's crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:29.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,but that was just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What if I was crying for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:41.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Why are you making that face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:45.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I figured the best way to cheer \Nyou up would be with a funny face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not that immature—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:59.27,main,Prospero(Male Club Member),0,0,0,,To credit his own lie, \Nhe did believe he was indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.84,main,Prospero(Male Club Member),0,0,0,,the Duke of Milan, out of the substitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:05.96,main,Prospero(Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Hence, his ambition growing—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.08,main,Prospero(Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Dost thou hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:13.42,main,Miranda (Rin),0,0,0,,Your tale, sir, would cure deafness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:17.41,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,To have no screen between \Nthis part he played
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.69,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,and him he played it for, \Nhe needs will be Absolute Milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:26.02,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Here cease more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:29.46,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Thou art inclined to sleep, Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.04,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Come away, servant, come. I am ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:35.42,main,Prospero (Male Club Member),0,0,0,,Approach, my Ariel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:40.68,main,Ariel (Female club member),0,0,0,,All hail, great master Prospero! \NI come to answer thy best pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:45.69,sign_8169_71_63rd_Kouban_Fes,Door sign,0,0,0,,{\move(151.4,178,195.4,193.2,25,4988)}63rd \NKouban\N Fes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:44.77,main,Ariel (Female club member),0,0,0,,Be it to fly, to swim...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:45.69,sign_8169_70_Sixty_Third_Koub,Banner sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H564841&\fs12\move(399,21.2,407,76.4,9,4138)}Sixty-Third Kouban High School Culture Festival
