Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.95,sign_8367_73_Sixty_Third_Koub,School sign,0,0,0,,{\frz16.03\pos(370.6,200.6)}{\blur1}Sixty-Third Kouban High\N School Culture Festival
